                        "value": "const dateNow = new Date()\r\nconst dateNowIsoString = dateNow.toISOString();\r\nconst startTimeIsoString = getStartTime();\r\nconst dateNowUtc = new Date(dateNowIsoString)\r\nconst startTimeUtc = new Date(startTimeIsoString);\r\nconst executionTimeMilliseconds = dateNowUtc.getTime() - startTimeUtc.getTime();\r\n\r\nlet response = JSON.parse(toJson(getSubworkflowOutput()));\r\nresponse.executionTimeMilliseconds = executionTimeMilliseconds;\r\nresponse.correlationId = getCorrelationId();\r\nreturn response;"
